{"spec": "v1", "title": "2025 新课标卷 14：两物块相碰后穿过一段段防滑带", "constants": {"g": 10}, "params": {"mu": [0.5, "", "μ"], "l1": [3, "m", "间隔"], "l2": [2.4, "m", "宽度"], "m1": [2, "kg", "P"], "m2": [4, "kg", "Q"], "v0": [7, "m/s", "Q 初速"], "e": [0.5, "", "碰后 P 速度 7 m/s 对应的恢复系数"]}, "scene": {"surfaces": [{"id": "来路", "from": [-3, 0], "to": [0, 0], "next": "带1"}, {"id": "带1", "from": [0, 0], "to": ["l2", 0], "mu": "mu", "next": "光1"}, {"id": "光1", "from": ["l2", 0], "to": ["l2+l1", 0], "next": "带2"}, {"id": "带2", "from": ["l2+l1", 0], "to": ["2*l2+l1", 0], "mu": "mu", "next": "光2"}, {"id": "光2", "from": ["2*l2+l1", 0], "to": ["2*l2+2*l1", 0], "next": "带3"}, {"id": "带3", "from": ["2*l2+2*l1", 0], "to": ["3*l2+2*l1", 0], "mu": "mu"}], "bodies": [{"id": "Q", "kind": "block", "m": "m2", "on": "来路", "at": 2.5, "v": "v0"}, {"id": "P", "kind": "block", "m": "m1", "on": "带1", "at": 0}], "collisions": [{"bodies": ["Q", "P"], "e": "e"}], "tMax": 12}, "asks": [{"id": "1", "text": "该碰撞过程中损失的机械能", "at": {"event": "collided", "bodies": ["Q", "P"]}, "expr": "Q(P,Q)", "answer": 24.5, "unit": "J"}, {"id": "2", "text": "P 从开始运动到静止经历的时间", "times": {"t1": {"event": "collided", "bodies": ["Q", "P"]}, "t2": {"event": "stop", "body": "P"}}, "expr": "t2-t1", "answer": 5, "unit": "s"}], "stem": "如图，在一段水平光滑直道上每间隔 $l_{1}=3 \\mathrm{~m}$ 铺设有宽度为 $l_{2}=2.4 \\mathrm{~m}$ 的防滑带。在最左端防滑带的左边缘静止有质量为 $m_{1}=2 \\mathrm{~kg}$ 的小物块 P，另一质量为 $m_{2}=4 \\mathrm{~kg}$ 的小物块 Q 以 $v_{0}=7 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}$ 的速度向右运动并与 P 发生正碰，且碰撞时间极短。已知碰撞后瞬间P 的速度大小为 $v=7 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}, \\mathrm{P} , \\mathrm{Q}$ 与防滑带间的动摩擦因数均为 $\\mu=0.5$ ，重力加速度大小 $g=10 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}^{2}$ 。求", "idea": "光滑段匀速，防滑带上匀减速，分段算时间。每过一条防滑带，速度平方减少一个定值。", "model": [{"from": "防滑带", "to": "一段段粗糙面"}, {"from": "小物块", "to": "质点"}], "solution": {"1": [{"say": "碰撞时间极短，动量守恒，求碰后 Q 的速度。", "tex": "m_2v_0=m_2v_Q+m_1v\\ \\Rightarrow\\ v_Q=3.5\\ \\mathrm{m/s}", "at": {"event": "collided", "bodies": ["Q", "P"]}}, {"say": "损失的机械能是碰前动能减碰后动能。", "tex": "\\Delta E=\\tfrac12m_2v_0^2-\\tfrac12m_2v_Q^2-\\tfrac12m_1v^2=24.5\\ \\mathrm{J}", "at": {"event": "collided", "bodies": ["Q", "P"]}}], "2": [{"say": "在防滑带上减速，加速度相同。", "tex": "a=\\mu g=5\\ \\mathrm{m/s^2}", "at": {"event": "time", "t": 1.0}, "show": {"forces": ["P"]}}, {"say": "每条防滑带让速度平方减少 $2al_2$。", "tex": "2al_2=24\\ \\mathrm{m^2/s^2}"}, {"say": "第一条：$49\\to25$，用时 0.4 s；光滑段 5 m/s 走 3 m 用时 0.6 s。", "tex": "t_1=0.4\\ \\mathrm{s},\\quad t_2=0.6\\ \\mathrm{s}", "at": {"event": "enter", "body": "P", "to": "带2"}}, {"say": "第二条：$25\\to1$，用时 0.8 s；光滑段 1 m/s 走 3 m 用时 3 s。", "tex": "t_3=0.8\\ \\mathrm{s},\\quad t_4=3\\ \\mathrm{s}", "at": {"event": "enter", "body": "P", "to": "带3"}}, {"say": "第三条上减速到零，用时 0.2 s。全部相加。", "tex": "t_5=0.2\\ \\mathrm{s},\\quad t=5\\ \\mathrm{s}", "at": {"event": "stop", "body": "P"}}]}}